# security-relevant code. The Security review status requires approval from
# @larsburgess for security-related changes once rollout is complete. Paths below are ordered least- to
# most-specific; the LAST matching pattern wins, so the security paths at the
# bottom override the catch-all at the top.
#
# This file routes review; it does not itself enforce approval. The target
# branch's copy is authoritative, and authors cannot approve their own PRs.
# Security review scope and evidence: docs/soc2/change-management.md.

